<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank crown/dollar fix at 31.621 (31.555).</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank crown/dollar fix at 31.621 (31.555).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) fixed the crown at 31.621 to the dollar after Tuesday's fixing at 31.555, and at 20.386 to the mark from 20.395.</p>
<p>The crown fixing is announced daily at about 1140 CET (1040 GMT), and is within plus/minus 5.0 percent of a dollar/mark basket midpoint calculated at exactly 11:30:00 CET.</p>
<p>The above rates imply a deviation from the midpoint of -1.00 percent, after a deviation of -0.94 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
